{"page":459,"verses":[{"verse_key":"39:6","surah":39,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"خَلَقَكُم مِّن نَّفْسٍ وَٰحِدَةٍ ثُمَّ جَعَلَ مِنْهَا زَوْجَهَا وَأَنزَلَ لَكُم مِّنَ ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ ثَمَـٰنِيَةَ أَزْوَٰجٍ ۚ يَخْلُقُكُمْ فِى بُطُونِ أُمَّهَـٰتِكُمْ خَلْقًا مِّنۢ بَعْدِ خَلْقٍ فِى ظُلُمَـٰتٍ ثَلَـٰثٍ ۚ ذَٰلِكُمُ ٱللَّهُ رَبُّكُمْ لَهُ ٱلْمُلْكُ ۖ لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ ۖ فَأَنَّىٰ تُصْرَفُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He created you all from a single being, from which He made its mate; He gave you four kinds of livestock in pairs; He creates you in your mothers’ wombs, in one stage after another, in threefold depths of darkness. Such is God, your Lord; He holds control, there is no god but Him. How can you turn away?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"خَلَقَكُم","en_gloss":"He created you","transliteration":"khalaqakum","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَّفْسٍۢ","en_gloss":"a soul","transliteration":"nafsin","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٰحِدَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"single","transliteration":"wāḥidatin","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"He made","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنْهَا","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"زَوْجَهَا","en_gloss":"its mate","transliteration":"zawjahā","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"And He sent down","transliteration":"wa-anzala","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","en_gloss":"the cattle","transliteration":"l-anʿāmi","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ثَمَـٰنِيَةَ","en_gloss":"eight","transliteration":"thamāniyata","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَزْوَٰجٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"kinds","transliteration":"azwājin","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَخْلُقُكُمْ","en_gloss":"He creates you","transliteration":"yakhluqukum","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بُطُونِ","en_gloss":"(the) wombs","transliteration":"buṭūni","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أُمَّهَـٰتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"(of) your mothers","transliteration":"ummahātikum","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":19,"ar":"خَلْقًۭا","en_gloss":"creation","transliteration":"khalqan","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":21,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":22,"ar":"خَلْقٍۢ","en_gloss":"creation","transliteration":"khalqin","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":23,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":24,"ar":"ظُلُمَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"darkness[es]","transliteration":"ẓulumātin","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ثَلَـٰثٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"three","transliteration":"thalāthin","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":26,"ar":"ذَٰلِكُمُ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālikumu","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(is) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":28,"ar":"رَبُّكُمْ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbukum","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":29,"ar":"لَهُ","en_gloss":"for Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":30,"ar":"ٱلْمُلْكُ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) the dominion","transliteration":"l-mul'ku","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":31,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"(There is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":32,"ar":"إِلَـٰهَ","en_gloss":"god","transliteration":"ilāha","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":33,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":34,"ar":"هُوَ ۖ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":35,"ar":"فَأَنَّىٰ","en_gloss":"Then how","transliteration":"fa-annā","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":36,"ar":"تُصْرَفُونَ","en_gloss":"are you turning away","transliteration":"tuṣ'rafūna","verse_key":"39:6"},{"pos":37,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:6"}]},{"verse_key":"39:7","surah":39,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"إِن تَكْفُرُوا۟ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَنِىٌّ عَنكُمْ ۖ وَلَا يَرْضَىٰ لِعِبَادِهِ ٱلْكُفْرَ ۖ وَإِن تَشْكُرُوا۟ يَرْضَهُ لَكُمْ ۗ وَلَا تَزِرُ وَازِرَةٌ وِزْرَ أُخْرَىٰ ۗ ثُمَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكُم مَّرْجِعُكُمْ فَيُنَبِّئُكُم بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ عَلِيمٌۢ بِذَاتِ ٱلصُّدُورِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you are ungrateful, remember God has no need of you, yet He is not pleased by ingrati-tude in His servants; if you are grateful, He is pleased [to see] it in you. No soul will bear another’s burden. You will return to your Lord in the end and He will inform you of what you have done: He knows well what is in the depths of [your] hearts.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَكْفُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"you disbelieve","transliteration":"takfurū","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"غَنِىٌّ","en_gloss":"(is) free from need","transliteration":"ghaniyyun","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَنكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"of you","transliteration":"ʿankum","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَرْضَىٰ","en_gloss":"He likes","transliteration":"yarḍā","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِعِبَادِهِ","en_gloss":"in His slaves","transliteration":"liʿibādihi","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْكُفْرَ ۖ","en_gloss":"ungratefulness","transliteration":"l-kuf'ra","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَشْكُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"you are grateful","transliteration":"tashkurū","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَرْضَهُ","en_gloss":"He likes it","transliteration":"yarḍahu","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَكُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"in you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تَزِرُ","en_gloss":"will bear","transliteration":"taziru","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَازِرَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"bearer of burdens","transliteration":"wāziratun","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وِزْرَ","en_gloss":"(the) burden","transliteration":"wiz'ra","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أُخْرَىٰ ۗ","en_gloss":"(of) another","transliteration":"ukh'rā","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":21,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":22,"ar":"رَبِّكُم","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbikum","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":23,"ar":"مَّرْجِعُكُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) your return","transliteration":"marjiʿukum","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":24,"ar":"فَيُنَبِّئُكُم","en_gloss":"then He will inform you","transliteration":"fayunabbi-ukum","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":25,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"about what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":26,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you used to","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":27,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ ۚ","en_gloss":"do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":28,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":29,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) the All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":30,"ar":"بِذَاتِ","en_gloss":"of what (is) in the breasts","transliteration":"bidhāti","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":31,"ar":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","en_gloss":"of what (is) in the breasts","transliteration":"l-ṣudūri","verse_key":"39:7"},{"pos":32,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:7"}]},{"verse_key":"39:8","surah":39,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَإِذَا مَسَّ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ ضُرٌّ دَعَا رَبَّهُۥ مُنِيبًا إِلَيْهِ ثُمَّ إِذَا خَوَّلَهُۥ نِعْمَةً مِّنْهُ نَسِىَ مَا كَانَ يَدْعُوٓا۟ إِلَيْهِ مِن قَبْلُ وَجَعَلَ لِلَّهِ أَندَادًا لِّيُضِلَّ عَن سَبِيلِهِۦ ۚ قُلْ تَمَتَّعْ بِكُفْرِكَ قَلِيلًا ۖ إِنَّكَ مِنْ أَصْحَـٰبِ ٱلنَّارِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When man suffers some affliction, he prays to his Lord and turns to Him, but once he has been granted a favour from God, he forgets the One he had been praying to and sets up rivals to God, to make others stray from His path. Say, ‘Enjoy your ingratitude for a little while: you will be one of the inhabitants of the Fire.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"39:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَسَّ","en_gloss":"touches","transliteration":"massa","verse_key":"39:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"[the] man","transliteration":"l-insāna","verse_key":"39:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ضُرٌّۭ","en_gloss":"adversity","transliteration":"ḍurrun","verse_key":"39:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"دَعَا","en_gloss":"he calls","transliteration":"daʿā","verse_key":"39:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَبَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"his Lord","transliteration":"rabbahu","verse_key":"39:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُنِيبًا","en_gloss":"turning","transliteration":"munīban","verse_key":"39:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"39:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"39:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"39:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"خَوَّلَهُۥ","en_gloss":"He bestows on him","transliteration":"khawwalahu","verse_key":"39:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نِعْمَةًۭ","en_gloss":"a favor","transliteration":"niʿ'matan","verse_key":"39:8"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِّنْهُ","en_gloss":"from Himself","translit