Fire","transliteration":"l-nāri","verse_key":"39:8"},{"pos":35,"ar":"٨","en_gloss":"(8)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:8"}]},{"verse_key":"39:9","surah":39,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"أَمَّنْ هُوَ قَـٰنِتٌ ءَانَآءَ ٱلَّيْلِ سَاجِدًا وَقَآئِمًا يَحْذَرُ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ وَيَرْجُوا۟ رَحْمَةَ رَبِّهِۦ ۗ قُلْ هَلْ يَسْتَوِى ٱلَّذِينَ يَعْلَمُونَ وَٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ ۗ إِنَّمَا يَتَذَكَّرُ أُو۟لُوا۟ ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"What about someone who worships devoutly during the night, bowing down, standing in prayer, ever mindful of the life to come, hoping for his Lord’s mercy? Say, ‘How can those who know be equal to those who do not know?’ Only those who have understanding will take heed.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمَّنْ","en_gloss":"Is (one) who","transliteration":"amman","verse_key":"39:9"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"[he]","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"39:9"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَـٰنِتٌ","en_gloss":"(is) devoutly obedient ","transliteration":"qānitun","verse_key":"39:9"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَانَآءَ","en_gloss":"(during) hours","transliteration":"ānāa","verse_key":"39:9"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلِ","en_gloss":"(of) the night","transliteration":"al-layli","verse_key":"39:9"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سَاجِدًۭا","en_gloss":"prostrating","transliteration":"sājidan","verse_key":"39:9"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَقَآئِمًۭا","en_gloss":"and standing","transliteration":"waqāiman","verse_key":"39:9"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَحْذَرُ","en_gloss":"fearing","transliteration":"yaḥdharu","verse_key":"39:9"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirata","verse_key":"39:9"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَيَرْجُوا۟","en_gloss":"and hoping","transliteration":"wayarjū","verse_key":"39:9"},{"pos":11,"ar":"رَحْمَةَ","en_gloss":"(for the) Mercy","transliteration":"raḥmata","verse_key":"39:9"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَبِّهِۦ ۗ","en_gloss":"(of) his Lord","transliteration":"rabbihi","verse_key":"39:9"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","ve